Subject: Align remediation posture with GitOps pull request workflow

Why: Upstream always tells the user to apply fixes manually and omits kube-agents' GitOps pull-request workflow (`agents/platform/SOUL.md` section 3). Keeping diagnosis requests report-only while routing explicit fix requests for manifest or ConfigMap changes through `submit-suggestion` matches the Platform Agent persona.
Local-Issue: none (adoption of gke-kueue-troubleshooting from google/skills)
Eval-Case: kueue-troubleshooting-mixed-flavor-tas-probe
Upstream-Issue: none (specific to this repository)
Retire-When: never; the GitOps `submit-suggestion` workflow is this repository's

